  "end": 853.85
 },
 {
  "en": "I just need to know where you were doing it and who you might've crossed paths with...",
  "start": 853.92,
  "end": 857.79
 },
 {
  "en": "... so I can find out who carved up Mr. Geary.",
  "start": 857.79,
  "end": 860.35
 },
 {
  "en": "Geary and I got a lead that one of the Fox River Eight was in town.",
  "start": 865.05,
  "end": 871.09
 },
 {
  "en": "Which one?",
  "start": 871.68,
  "end": 872.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Theodore Bagwell.",
  "start": 873.25,
  "end": 876.15
 },
 {
  "en": "The man who did those horrible things...",
  "start": 873.25,
  "end": 876.15
 },
 {
  "en": "... to those teenagers?",
  "start": 876.19,
  "end": 878.05
 },
 {
  "en": "That's him.",
  "start": 876.19,
  "end": 878.05
 },
 {
  "en": "We're gonna bring him in for the reward money but we couldn't get a handle.",
  "start": 878.14,
  "end": 881.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Geary and I split up, we figured we didn't have a shot, but",
  "start": 881.57,
  "end": 884.26
 },
 {
  "en": "But what?",
  "start": 884.32,
  "end": 886.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, after what happened...",
  "start": 884.32,
  "end": 886.31
 },
 {
  "en": "... I'm starting to think maybe Geary ran into old Bagwell after all.",
  "start": 886.4,
  "end": 890.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Right here in Tribune?",
  "start": 890.56,
  "end": 892.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, Brad, do you think you could answer some questions...",
  "start": 894.37,
  "end": 897.06
 },
 {
  "en": "... that might help us, you know, track down Theodore Bagwell?",
  "start": 897.12,
  "end": 900.32
 },
 {
  "en": "I'd be indebted.",
  "start": 900.35,
  "end": 901.84
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll do whatever I can to help nail that son of a bitch.",
  "start": 901.95,
  "end": 905.35
 },
 {
  "en": "You think Sara has this tape?",
  "start": 905.37,
  "end": 907.24
 },
 {
  "en": "The government does.",
  "start": 907.33,
  "end": 908.69
 },
 {
  "en": "I just saw her yesterday. If she does have anything...",
  "start": 910.59,
  "end": 912.99
 },
 {
  "en": "... she doesn't know.",
  "start": 913.05,
  "end": 914.32
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, where is she now?",
  "start": 914.88,
  "end": 917.71
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know.",
  "start": 914.88,
  "end": 917.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Any way you can get in touch with her?",
  "start": 918.08,
  "end": 920.41
 },
 {
  "en": "We bought cell phones. I could call her.",
  "start": 920.48,
  "end": 923.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Please, please, please, bro.",
  "start": 920.48,
  "end": 923.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Call her from Panama, please.",
  "start": 923.71,
  "end": 926.3
 },
 {
  "en": "We got less than two hours. I gotta make the flight.",
  "start": 926.37,
  "end": 929.63
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 933.02,
  "end": 934.39
 },
 {
  "en": "Run. Run!",
  "start": 938.49,
  "end": 940.55
 },
 {
  "en": "Where's this car you keep talking about?",
  "start": 946.75,
  "end": 949.72
 },
 {
  "en": "It's over the ridge.",
  "start": 946.75,
  "end": 949.72
 },
 {
  "en": "Give me that. You guys head for the car.",
  "start": 949.76,
  "end": 951.75
 },
 {
  "en": "Go!",
  "start": 952.54,
  "end": 954.3
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on, come on!",
  "start": 961.53,
  "end": 962.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on! Go, go, go!",
  "start": 969.95,
  "end": 971.78
 },
 {
  "en": "Pick up Dad!",
  "start": 973.18,
  "end": 974.55
 },
 {
  "en": "Dad, get in!",
  "start": 976.64,
  "end": 978.47
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on, Dad!",
  "start": 981.47,
  "end": 983.37
 },
 {
  "en": "We made it! Son of a bitch, we made it!",
  "start": 991.74,
  "end": 995.08
 },
 {
  "en": "Linc.",
  "start": 1001.47,
  "end": 1002.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Sucre, get us to a hospital.",
  "start": 1016.09,
  "end": 1018.32
 },
 {
  "en": "Out here? Where the hell am I gonna find--?",
  "start": 1018.4,
  "end": 1022.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Just get us to a hospital, please!",
  "start": 1018.4,
  "end": 1022.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't worry, you're gonna make it.",
  "start": 1022.81,
  "end": 1025.28
 },
 {
  "en": "It's bile. He got me clean through.",
  "start": 1025.41,
  "end": 1028.4
 },
 {
  "en": "You're gonna be okay. Just hold on.",
  "start": 1028.45,
  "end": 1031.54
 },
 {
  "en": "Listen to me, both of you.",
  "start": 1031.58,
  "end": 1034.02
 },
 {
  "en": "Sorry.",
  "start": 1036.09,
  "end": 1037.89
 },
 {
  "en": "I wish I'd never left.",
  "start": 1037.98,
  "end": 1040.28
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't talk. Just breathe, okay?",
  "start": 1041.92,
  "end": 1045.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay. So do you want a P. B.& B.?",
  "start": 1049.6,
  "end": 1052.46
 },
 {
  "en": "Not really. My tummy hurts.",
  "start": 1052.51,
  "end": 1056.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Where's her knapsack?",
  "start": 1057.95,
  "end": 1059.18
 },
 {
  "en": "Her what?",
  "start": 1060.19,
  "end": 1061.21
 },
 {
  "en": "Her knapsack. Her medicine's in it.",
  "start": 1061.95,
  "end": 1065.82
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know. I just grabbed her and ran.",
  "start": 1061.95,
  "end": 1065.82
 },
 {
  "en": "She needs that medicine. She can't go two days without it.",
  "start": 1065.82,
  "end": 1068.65
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay, I know. I'm her father, all right?",
  "start": 1069.25,
  "end": 1071.21
 },
 {
  "en": "Where is it?",
  "start": 1072.25,
  "end": 1073.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Baby, baby. Look, look, calm down. What are you looking for?",
  "start": 1073.69,
  "end": 1076.36
 },
 {
  "en": "Just tell me what it is and I'll go ahead and get it, okay?",
  "start": 1076.41,
  "end": 1079.14
 },
 {
  "en": "Her prescription.",
  "start": 1079.2,
  "end": 1080.89
 },
 {
  "en": "It's a backup. I keep an extra, in case.",
  "start": 1082.21,
  "end": 1084.97
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay, okay.",
  "start": 1085.02,
  "end": 1087.29
 },
 {
  "en": "So all I need to do is find a pharmacy.",
  "start": 1087.36,
  "end": 1092.52
 },
 {
  "en": "Don't worry.",
  "start": 1096.03,
  "end": 1098.0
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, looks like we're going on a ride, sweet pea.",
  "start": 1098.11,
  "end": 1101.1
 },
 {
  "en": "If we nail Bagwell, he might still have some of Geary's things on him...",
  "start": 1101.15,
  "end": 1104.48
 },
 {
  "en": "... like his backpack, which has his personal stuff in it.",
  "start": 1104.51,
  "end": 1107.07
 },
 {
  "en": "I know his wife would love to have it.",
  "start": 1107.13,
  "end": 1109.57
 },
 {
  "en": "If we find Bagwell...",
  "start": 1109.63,
  "end": 1110.62
 },
 {
  "en": "... give it to her personally.",
  "start": 1110.75,
  "end": 1112.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Thanks.",
  "start": 1110.75,
  "end": 1112.44
 },
 {
  "en": "It's the least I can do considering how you're helping me out.",
  "start": 1112.54,
  "end": 1115.67
 },
 {
  "en": "Although some of the guys on the force are concerned about....",
  "start": 1115.71,
  "end": 1118.64
 },
 {
  "en": "What are they concerned about?",
  "start": 1118.69,
  "end": 1122.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, nothing.",
  "start": 1118.69,
  "end": 1122.25
 },
 {
  "en": "You know what? Why don't you tell me what you know?",
  "start": 1122.69,
  "end": 1124.95
 },
 {
  "en": "We'll track down Bagwell, get Geary's effects to his family.",
  "start": 1125.02,
  "end": 1127.79
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll make sure everybody involved knows your help was invaluable.",
  "start": 1127.84,
  "end": 1130.74
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll even recommend that you get most of, if not all of that reward money.",
  "start": 1130.78,
  "end": 1134.72
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, what is it exactly that the guys on the force were concerned about?",
  "start": 1135.2,
  "end": 1139.29
 },
 {
  "en": "Some of them thought you weren't being totally upfront about your injury.",
  "start": 1141.25,
  "end": 1144.61
 },
 {
  "en": "I mean, to be fair, it does seem a little off that you didn't see the guy...",
  "start": 1144.64,
  "end": 1148.01
 },
 {
  "en": "... who hit you smack-dab on the forehead.",
  "start": 1148.03,
  "end": 1151.4
 },
 {
  "en": "You got me.",
  "start": 1154.72,
  "end": 1156.41
 },
 {
  "en": "Geary and me had a little dust-up over how to go about finding Bagwell.",
  "start": 1157.57,
  "end": 1161.85
 },
 {
  "en": "It got physical and he hit me.",
  "start": 1161.85,
  "end": 1165.15
 },
 {
  "en": "The two of us, we fought like brothers. I didn't wanna rat him out to the cops.",
  "start": 1165.18,
  "end": 1169.02
 },
 {
  "en": "After the fight, we split up.",
  "start": 1170.33,
  "end": 1173.3
 },
 {
  "en": "And then....",
  "start": 1173.85,
  "end": 1175.32
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, you know what happened to him.",
  "start": 1177.73,
  "end": 1179.42
 },
 {
  "en": "I just wish to hell we'd never fought, you know.",
  "start": 1181.37,
  "end": 1183.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Maybe then, he'd still be....",
  "start": 1183.65,
  "end": 1186.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Brad, you can't blame yourself.",
  "start": 1187.61,
  "end": 1190.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Why don't we refocus our energy on finding the man who killed your friend?",
  "start": 1192.77,
  "end": 1197.13
 },
 {
  "en": "That's what Roy would've wanted.",
  "start": 1199.81,
  "end": 1202.43
 },
 {
  "en": "Where you at, baby?",
  "start": 1220.38,
  "end": 1222.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Insurance card?",
  "start": 1223.81,
  "end": 1225.83
 },
 {
  "en": "No, I don't have insurance.",
  "start": 1225.92,
  "end": 1228.08
 },
 {
  "en": "You're paying for dexamethasone without insurance?",
  "start": 1228.16,
  "end": 1231.09
 },
 {
  "en": "You got Medicaid, Medicare or something?",
  "start": 1231.13,
  "end": 1234.26
 },
 {
  "en": "Nope. I'll just pay cash.",
  "start": 1234.49,
  "end": 1236.55
 },
 {
  "en": "It's 1 25.",
  "start": 1237.15,
  "end": 1238.95
 },
 {
  "en": "Excuse me.",
  "start": 1249.92,
  "end": 1251.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Excuse me?",
  "start": 1252.7,
  "end": 1254.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, sorry.",
  "start": 1256.16,
  "end": 1257.52
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry I don't have anything smaller.",
  "start": 1267.29,
  "end": 1270.23
 },
 {
  "en": "I have to go to the back to get change for a hundred.",
  "start": 1271.84,
  "end": 1274.17
 },
 {
  "en": "So I'll be right back.",
  "start": 1274.24,
  "end": 1275.9
 },
 {
  "en": "Right there, hospital!",
  "start": 1288.16,
  "end": 1290.13
 },
 {
  "en": "I see it, I see it.",
  "start": 1288.16,
  "end": 1290.13
 },
 {
  "en": "Just get us there.",
  "start": 1290.21,
  "end": 1292.11
 },
 {
  "en": "No, you'll be caught.",
  "start": 1290.21,
  "end": 1292.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Then we'll be caught.",
  "start": 1292.19,
  "end": 1294.16
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not gonna let you die.",
  "start": 1294.78,
  "end": 1296.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Then listen to me.",
  "start": 1296.67,
  "end": 1298.47
 },
 {
  "en": "You find Sara Tancredi.",
  "start": 1298.56,
  "end": 1301.46
 },
 {
  "en": "She can end this.",
  "start": 1301.73,
  "end": 1303.89
 },
 {
  "en": "It's up to you now.",
  "start": 1305.12,
  "end": 1307.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, I want an alarm out on a dark blue sedan, license AE 9268.",
  "start": 1317.92,
  "end": 1322.37
 },
 {
  "en": "Forty miles southeast of Las Cruces.",
  "start": 1322.37,
  "end": 1324.77
 },
 {
  "en": "Do it now.",
  "start": 1325.21,
  "end": 1327.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, come on.",
  "start": 1329.47,
  "end": 1331.53
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 1332.93,
  "end": 1334.59
 },
 {
  "en": "What hospital?",
  "start": 1336.09,
  "end": 1337.49
 },
 {
  "en": "Came in with a bad Gunshot wound. Docs called us in.",
  "start": 1344.54,
  "end": 1347.51
 },
 {
  "en": "He's in here.",
  "start": 1347.55,
  "end": 1349.61
 },
 {
  "en": "We ran his name.",
  "start": 1349.69,
  "end": 1351.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Came back with two federal drug-smuggling warrants out on him.",
  "start": 1351.33,
  "end": 1355.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Heard you wanted to talk to me.",
  "start": 1356.03,
  "end": 1357.5
 },
 {
  "en": "I got some information the feds want.",
  "start": 1361.31,
  "end": 1363.71
 },
 {
  "en": "About Michael Scofield.",
  "start": 1364.86,
  "end": 1366.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Like where he's catching a ride.",
  "start": 1370.49,
  "end": 1372.59
 },
 {
  "en": "And where would that be?",
  "start": 1373.34,
  "end": 1375.61
 },
 {
  "en": "It's not just the where, but the when.",
  "start": 1376.19,
  "end": 1380.49
 },
 {
  "en": "That when is coming up soon.",
  "start": 1381.18,
  "end": 1383.38
 },
 {
  "en": "But I wanna cut a deal first.",
  "start": 1384.86,
  "end": 1386.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Give us a minute?",
  "start": 1389.92,
  "end": 1391.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Anything you wanna say?",
  "start": 1401.92,
  "end": 1403.58
 },
 {
  "en": "One day.",
  "start": 1405.47,
  "end": 1407.2
 },
 {
  "en": "That's all we had.",
  "start": 1408.29,
  "end": 1410.41
 },
 {
  "en": "Back then, when things were at their worst...",
  "start": 1433.31,
  "end": 1438.21
 },
 {
  "en": "... there were days I thought I'd never see the sun again.",
  "start": 1438.94,
  "end": 1442.31
 },
 {
  "en": "But he saved my life.",
  "start": 1443.07,
  "end": 1445.23
 },
 {
  "en": "Just wish he could've let us be a part of his.",
  "start": 1449.15,
  "end": 1452.31
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 1457.63,
  "end": 1459.29
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll tell him.",
  "start": 1467.74,
  "end": 1469.61
 },
 {
  "en": "Here's the deal.",
  "start": 1474.11,
  "end": 1475.7
 },
 {
  "en": "All charges dropped, government picks up medical costs...",
  "start": 1475.81,
  "end": 1478.37
 },
 {
  "en": "... until you're fit to be deported.",
  "start": 1478.43,
  "end": 1480.06
 },
 {
  "en": "All contingent upon your information being accurate.",
  "start": 1480.16,
  "end": 1483.68
 },
 {
  "en": "Where's Scofield?",
  "start": 1485.05,
  "end": 1486.28
 },
 {
  "en": "No deportation. I want citizenship.",
  "start": 1487.26,
  "end": 1490.46
 },
 {
  "en": "Citizenship?",
  "start": 1491.61,
  "end": 1493.64
 },
 {
  "en": "A little incentive, and I want it in writing.",
  "start": 1493.72,
  "end": 1497.59
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, I'm so tired of playing games.",
  "start": 1497.6,
  "end": 1499.79
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, start typing.",
  "start": 1500.29,
  "end": 1502.15
 },
 {
  "en": "No external pacemaker.",
  "start": 1508.35,
  "end": 1510.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, this is a good one. No morphine drip.",
  "start": 1511.36,
  "end": 1515.05
 },
 {
  "en": "What are you doing?",
  "start": 1515.07,
  "end": 1517.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Fbi. Out, out, out.",
  "start": 1515.07,
  "end": 1517.6
 },
 {
  "en": "What the hell are you doing?",
  "start": 1518.56,
  "end": 1522.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Giving you a little incentive.",
  "start": 1518.56,
  "end": 1522.05
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on. Come on, you son of a",
  "start": 1522.72,
  "end": 1524.88
 },
 {
  "en": "And they found nothing?",
  "start": 1525.21,
  "end": 1526.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay, thanks.",
  "start": 1527.45,
  "end": 1529.39
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, your instincts are great, Brad.",
  "start": 1529.69,
  "end": 1531.35
 },
 {
  "en": "But the precinct actually sent a unit over to Hollander's house today.",
  "start": 1531.45,
  "end": 1534.72
 },
 {
  "en": "An anonymous caller said they saw an intruder but no one was there.",
  "start": 1534.75,
  "end": 1537.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Damn it.",
  "start": 1537.79,
  "end": 1539.35
 },
 {
  "en": "If you knew about Bagwell and Hollander...",
  "start": 1539.45,
  "end": 1541.28
 },
 {
  "en": "... why didn't you just head over there yourself?",
  "start": 1541.37,
  "end": 1543.5
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, we couldn't find the house.",
  "start": 1543.81,
  "end": 1546.17
 },
 {
  "en": "Really? It's listed.",
  "start": 1546.78,
  "end": 1549.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Excuse me.",
  "start": 1555.45,
  "end": 1556.94
 },
 {
  "en": "Thank you.",
  "start": 1564.13,
  "end": 1565.92
 },
 {
  "en": "Everything okay?",
  "start": 1566.88,
  "end": 1568.78
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, yeah, everything's fine.",
  "start": 1569.5,
  "end": 1572.1
 },
 {
  "en": "You ever been to the Fauntleroy Hotel? It's about 1 5 minutes from here.",
  "start": 1573.63,
  "end": 1576.79
 },
 {
  "en": "Never heard of it.",
  "start": 1576.83,
  "end": 1579.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Well, that's strange.",
  "start": 1576.83,
  "end": 1579.99
 },
 {
  "en": "Because they found this receipt in Geary's hotel room.",
  "start": 1580.03,
  "end": 1582.62
 },
 {
  "en": "It's from your credit card.",
  "start": 1582.68,
  "end": 1584.15
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know how that got there.",
  "start": 1587.42,
  "end": 1589.12
 },
 {
  "en": "I think you're being evasive.",
  "start": 1594.46,
  "end": 1596.83
 },
 {
  "en": "You should tell me the truth, Mr. Bellick.",
  "start": 1597.24,
  "end": 1601.11
 },
 {
  "en": "What happened to \"Brad\"?",
  "start": 1597.24,
  "end": 1601.11
 },
 {
  "en": "About seven years ago, I got my first homicide case.",
  "start": 1602.17,
  "end": 1604.47
 },
 {
  "en": "A woman. Pretty. She was brutally attacked.",
  "start": 1604.54,
  "end": 1606.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Animal boyfriend left her for dead.",
  "start": 1606.65,
  "end": 1608.98
 },
 {
  "en": "But she was still breathing, barely.",
  "start": 1609.05,
  "end": 1611.89
 },
 {
  "en": "But she punched into her cell phone...",
  "start": 1611.93,
  "end": 1614.4
 },
 {
  "en": "... the killer's number, so she solved the crime for us.",
  "start": 1614.46,
  "end": 1617.83
 },
 {
  "en": "When we found the receipt, Brad, it was in Geary's hand...",
  "start": 1618.43,
  "end": 1620.99
 },
 {
  "en": "... his finger pointing to your name. With his last ounce of strength...",
  "start": 1621.05,
  "end": 1624.22
 },
 {
  "en": "... he told us you killed him.",
  "start": 1624.25,
  "end": 1626.24
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay, listen.",
  "start": 1624.25,
  "end": 1626.24
 },
 {
  "en": "Geary and I found Bagwell in Hollander's house.",
  "start": 1626.33,
  "end": 1629.06
 },
 {
  "en": "We roughed him up until he told us where he'd hid the 5 million bucks...",
  "start": 1629.12,
  "end": 1632.78
 },
 {
  "en": "... we knew he'd dug up in Utah.",
  "start": 1632.8,
  "end": 1634.32
 },
 {
  "en": "When we found the money, Geary double-crossed me...",
  "start": 1634.43,
  "end": 1636.73
 },
 {
  "en": "... he hit me in the head and took the cash.",
  "start": 1636.8,
  "end": 1638.86
 },
 {
  "en": "I had nothing to do with Geary's death. You hear what I'm saying?",
  "start": 1638.94,
  "end": 1642.24
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm the victim here, not that son of a bitch.",
  "start": 1642.27,
  "end": 1644.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, come on, come on, come on.",
  "start": 1654.43,
  "end": 1657.69
 },
 {
  "en": "Where you at, baby?",
  "start": 1657.72,
  "end": 1659.09
 },
 {
  "en": "Hey, could you hurry it up?",
  "start": 1664.48,
  "end": 1666.74
 },
 {
  "en": "It's just it's getting really late and I gotta get home.",
  "start": 1666.81,
  "end": 1669.71
 },
 {
  "en": "And that's 20, 40, 50 and 20 is 70.",
  "start": 1675.68,
  "end": 1681.95
 },
 {
  "en": "One, two, three, four, five is 75.",
  "start": 1681.95,
  "end": 1687.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Excuse me.",
  "start": 1688.96,
  "end": 1690.79
 },
 {
  "en": "You gotta be kidding me.",
  "start": 1701.34,
  "end": 1703.71
 },
 {
  "en": "Ma'am.",
  "start": 1712.48,
  "end": 1714.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Afternoon, officer.",
  "start": 1714.81,
  "end": 1716.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Do you have any I'd with you?",
  "start": 1717.47,
  "end": 1719.96
 },
 {
  "en": "No, I walked over here, so I didn't carry anything with me.",
  "start": 1720.12,
  "end": 1723.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Did you? Where'd you walk from?",
  "start": 1723.84,
  "end": 1726.33
 },
 {
  "en": "Is there a problem, officer?",
  "start": 1727.16,
  "end": 1728.93
 },
 {
  "en": "There's only a problem if you make one, Miss Franklin.",
  "start": 1729.02,
  "end": 1732.35
 },
 {
  "en": "You want to tell us where your husband is?",
  "start": 1732.38,
  "end": 1734.25
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know.",
  "start": 1736.77,
  "end": 1738.53
 },
 {
  "en": "Place your hands behind your back, please, ma'am.",
  "start": 1738.62,
  "end": 1741.68
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, baby, I'm so sorry.",
  "start": 1751.42,
  "end": 1754.15
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, my God.",
  "start": 1769.31,
  "end": 1771.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Where is Mommy?",
  "start": 1772.51,
  "end": 1773.91
 },
 {
  "en": "Mommy is gonna meet us later, okay?",
  "start": 1776.7,
  "end": 1781.14
 },
 {
  "en": "Yes?",
  "start": 1786.43,
  "end": 1789.23
 },
 {
  "en": "Where's the photo?",
  "start": 1786.43,
  "end": 1789.23
 },
 {
  "en": "Bill, there was a tactical error.",
  "start": 1789.34,
  "end": 1790.81
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't want terminology from the Cover Your Ass Handbook, Paul.",
  "start": 1791.16,
  "end": 1794.5
 },
 {
  "en": "What happened?",
  "start": 1794.53,
  "end": 1797.89
 },
 {
  "en": "There were unforeseen circumstances.",
  "start": 1794.53,
  "end": 1797.89
 },
 {
  "en": "Things that could not be predicted.",
  "start": 1797.92,
  "end": 1800.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Where's Sara?",
  "start": 1797.92,
  "end": 1800.98
 },
 {
  "en": "She's gone, isn't she?",
  "start": 1802.08,
  "end": 1804.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Yes. She got away.",
  "start": 1808.44,
  "end": 1810.41
 },
 {
  "en": "But there is no way that she",
  "start": 1810.49,
  "end": 1812.46
 },
 {
  "en": "Bill?",
  "start": 1813.5,
  "end": 1815.23
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm not gonna let you die.",
  "start": 1883.68,
  "end": 1886.31
 },
 {
  "en": "I love you.",
  "start": 1889.63,
  "end": 1890.86
 },
 {
  "en": "You know that, don't you?",
  "start": 1893.79,
  "end": 1895.81
 },
 {
  "en": "Too many.",
  "start": 1909.85,
  "end": 1911.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Too many people died because I wanted you to be free.",
  "start": 1912.86,
  "end": 1916.69
 },
 {
  "en": "You couldn't have known, Michael.",
  "start": 1916.92,
  "end": 1918.92
 },
 {
  "en": "You couldn't have known it would've ended up like this.",
  "start": 1919.71,
  "end": 1922.4
 },
 {
  "en": "But it did.",
  "start": 1922.46,
  "end": 1923.76
 },
 {
  "en": "They wanted him.",
  "start": 1926.59,
  "end": 1928.08
 },
 {
  "en": "They wanted him in the ground...",
  "start": 1928.99,
  "end": 1931.46
 },
 {
  "en": "... and they got their wish.",
  "start": 1931.71,
  "end": 1933.07
 },
 {
  "en": "This thing's not gonna end here, Michael.",
  "start": 1934.59,
  "end": 1937.39
 },
 {
  "en": "I know.",
  "start": 1939.07,
  "end": 1941.09
 },
 {
  "en": "It's gonna keep spreading.",
  "start": 1939.07,
  "end": 1941.09
 },
 {
  "en": "Their hands are gonna get more and more bloody.",
  "start": 1943.55,
  "end": 1946.28
 },
 {
  "en": "The question is...",
  "start": 1946.78,
  "end": 1948.41
 },
 {
  "en": "... is the blood on their hands or ours?",
  "start": 1948.51,
  "end": 1952.47
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry, guys.",
  "start": 1958.72,
  "end": 1959.94
 },
 {
  "en": "We gotta go.",
  "start": 1961.31,
  "end": 1963.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Get back on with border patrol. Call the Navy Reserve Air Station in Dallas.",
  "start": 1981.34,
  "end": 1984.8
 },
 {
  "en": "They've got planes on alert.",
  "start": 1984.83,
  "end": 1986.06
 },
 {
  "en": "We need an intercept of a white single-engine A-36 Beech...",
  "start": 1986.17,
  "end": 1988.77
 },
 {
  "en": "... heading toward the border.",
  "start": 1988.83,
  "end": 1990.16
 },
 {
  "en": "Call Mexico. Get clearance for an international pursuit.",
  "start": 1990.27,
  "end": 1993.26
 },
 {
  "en": "Tell them if they've gotta take the plane down, just do it.",
  "start": 1993.31,
  "end": 1996.4
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on, guys.",
  "start": 2038.3,
  "end": 2040.23
 },
 {
  "en": "Guys, come on.",
  "start": 2040.89,
  "end": 2042.15
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on, guys.",
  "start": 2042.3,
  "end": 2043.77
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 2046.43,
  "end": 2047.62
 },
 {
  "en": "We're staying.",
  "start": 2049.85,
  "end": 2051.25
 },
 {
  "en": "Michael, this is what we've been waiting for.",
  "start": 2056.8,
  "end": 2060.13
 },
 {
  "en": "Maybe we'll see you down there somewhere.",
  "start": 2060.16,
  "end": 2062.72
 },
 {
  "en": "I can't talk you out of this one, can I?",
  "start": 2063.64,
  "end": 2066.11
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, I hope so.",
  "start": 2073.37,
  "end": 2074.6
 },
 {
  "en": "Be good.",
  "start": 2075.58,
  "end": 2077.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Thank you, Michael. Thank you for everything.",
  "start": 2077.47,
  "end": 2081.06
 },
 {
  "en": "You take care of him, all right?",
  "start": 2086.2,
  "end": 2088.04
 },
 {
  "en": "I will.",
  "start": 2086.2,
  "end": 2088.04
 },
 {
  "en": "Fly safe, papi.",
  "start": 2089.28,
  "end": 2090.51
 },
 {
  "en": "Give them hell.",
  "start": 2094.49,
  "end": 2096.29
 },
 {
  "en": "Panama would've been good.",
  "start": 2113.18,
  "end": 2115.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you ready for this?",
  "start": 2113.18,
  "end": 2115.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Been waiting years.",
  "start": 2116.25,
  "end": 2118.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Good to hear it.",
  "start": 2116.25,
  "end": 2118.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Because today's the day we stop running.",
  "start": 2118.81,
  "end": 2121.61
 },
 {
  "en": "What now?",
  "start": 2137.47,
  "end": 2139.49
 },
 {
  "en": "We go back to the car...",
  "start": 2137.47,
  "end": 2139.49
 },
 {
  "en": "... drive to a border town, find a cell phone signal...",
  "start": 2139.58,
  "end": 2142.64
 },
 {
  "en": "... and call Sara.",
  "start": 2142.68,
  "end": 2144.78
 },
 {
  "en": "Where the hell are those jets?",
  "start": 2155.93,
  "end": 2157.92
 },
 {
  "en": "You hear that?",
  "start": 2168.51,
  "end": 2170.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah.",
  "start": 2168.51,
  "end": 2170.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Pull over.",
  "start": 2174.24,
  "end": 2175.93
 },
 {
  "en": "They're going after Sucre.",
  "start": 2187.23,
  "end": 2189.72
 },
 {
  "en": "They're gonna take him down.",
  "start": 2190.11,
  "end": 2192.34
 },
 {
  "en": "How'd they find out?",
  "start": 2192.54,
  "end": 2195.63
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't know.",
  "start": 2192.54,
  "end": 2195.63
 },
 {
  "en": "Michael.",
  "start": 2199.64,
  "end": 2201.41
 },
 {
  "en": "What the hell is going on?",
  "start": 2230.84,
  "end": 2232.0
 },
 {
  "en": "If you could arrest me you would have already.",
  "start": 2232.12,
  "end": 2234.18
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm out of here.",
  "start": 2234.27,
  "end": 2236.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Not really an option for you.",
  "start": 2234.27,
  "end": 2236.74
 },
 {
  "en": "What've you got? A receipt? He left it in his pocket. A fight? Big deal.",
  "start": 2236.8,
  "end": 2240.03
 },
 {
  "en": "I got 1 0 pals in Chicago who'll tell you Geary and I threw down once a month.",
  "start": 2240.09,
  "end": 2243.69
 },
 {
  "en": "You're right. Any of those things on their own, probably not enough.",
  "start": 2243.71,
  "end": 2247.04
 },
 {
  "en": "But when you add this.",
  "start": 2247.07,
  "end": 2248.59
 },
 {
  "en": "What the hell is that?",
  "start": 2249.44,
  "end": 2251.13
 },
 {
  "en": "You left a message for Mr. Geary.",
  "start": 2251.23,
  "end": 2253.42
 },
 {
  "en": "You thieving son of a bitch.",
  "start": 2254.78,
  "end": 2257.15
 },
 {
  "en": "You better get down on your knees and pray to God that I don't find you.",
  "start": 2257.21,
  "end": 2260.41
 },
 {
  "en": "Because if I do, mark my words, I'm gonna gut you bow to stern.",
  "start": 2260.44,
  "end": 2265.01
 },
 {
  "en": "You wanna hear it again?",
  "start": 2267.42,
  "end": 2268.94
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, at this juncture, Brad...",
  "start": 2271.42,
  "end": 2272.75
 },
 {
  "en": "... things will go a whole lot easier for you if you admit to the crime.",
  "start": 2272.86,
  "end": 2276.06
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, you listen to me, you manipulative little bitch.",
  "start": 2276.38,
  "end": 2279.91
 },
 {
  "en": "I did not kill Roy Geary! You understand what I'm telling you?",
  "start": 2280.99,
  "end": 2283.98
 },
 {
  "en": "Bagwell set me up! Get your hands off of me!",
  "start": 2284.03,
  "end": 2286.76
 },
 {
  "en": "You are under arrest for the murder of Roy William Geary.",
  "start": 2287.16,
  "end": 2290.03
 },
 {
  "en": "You have a right to remain silent. Anything you say...",
  "start": 2290.08,
  "end": 2292.48
 },
 {
  "en": "... can be used against you. You have the right to a lawyer...",
  "start": 2292.54,
  "end": 2295.24
 },
 {
  "en": "... and to have him present. If you cannot hire a lawyer...",
  "start": 2295.29,
  "end": 2297.95
 },
 {
  "en": "... the court will appoint one for you.",
  "start": 2298.01,
  "end": 2299.98
 },
 {
  "en": "President Reynolds ' office.",
  "start": 2309.47,
  "end": 2310.7
 },
 {
  "en": "This is Agent Paul Kellerman.",
  "start": 2310.81,
  "end": 2312.11
 },
 {
  "en": "I need to speak with the president right now, please.",
  "start": 2312.22,
  "end": 2314.71
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry, this administration isn't familiar with an Agent Kellerman.",
  "start": 2314.78,
  "end": 2317.88
 },
 {
  "en": "June, it's me. I need to speak with Caroline now.",
  "start": 2317.92,
  "end": 2322.18
 },
 {
  "en": "If you don't put me through...",
  "start": 2322.65,
  "end": 2323.98
 },
 {
  "en": "... I'll make certain the president knows that you did not allow me...",
  "start": 2324.09,
  "end": 2327.15
 },
 {
  "en": "... to provide her with some very important information. Now.",
  "start": 2327.2,
  "end": 2330.46
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry, this administration isn't familiar with an Agent",
  "start": 2331.2,
  "end": 2335.1
 },
 {
  "en": "Please leave a message after the tone.",
  "start": 2346.33,
  "end": 2348.39
 },
 {
  "en": "Bill, don't do this.",
  "start": 2349.37,
  "end": 2351.36
 },
 {
  "en": "I've dedicated my life to this country. To Caroline.",
  "start": 2351.45,
  "end": 2354.58
 },
 {
  "en": "Everything I have, I give.",
  "start": 2354.62,
  "end": 2356.49
 },
 {
  "en": "Every photo. Every file. Get rid of it all.",
  "start": 2356.57,
  "end": 2360.27
 },
 {
  "en": "Make him a ghost.",
  "start": 2360.28,
  "end": 2363.25
 },
 {
  "en": "I've been a perfect soldier.",
  "start": 2360.28,
  "end": 2363.25
 },
 {
  "en": "I've never asked anything of you ever.",
  "start": 2363.29,
  "end": 2366.09
 },
 {
  "en": "But I'm asking now.",
  "start": 2366.49,
  "end": 2368.79
 },
 {
  "en": "Bill, don't do this.",
  "start": 2368.86,
  "end": 2371.06
 },
 {
  "en": "I don't see him.",
  "start": 2376.03,
  "end": 2380.26
 },
 {
  "en": "Trust me, we haven't lost him yet.",
  "start": 2376.03,
  "end": 2380.26
 },
 {
  "en": "Linc, stop the car.",
  "start": 2388.73,
  "end": 2390.79
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 2390.88,
  "end": 2393.64
 },
 {
  "en": "We gotta stop the car.",
  "start": 2390.88,
  "end": 2393.64
 },
 {
  "en": "That's a radio tower over there.",
  "start": 2399.8,
  "end": 2401.6
 },
 {
  "en": "It must be picking up some kind of analog signal.",
  "start": 2401.69,
  "end": 2404.66
 },
 {
  "en": "We gotta get closer. Turn around.",
  "start": 2404.7,
  "end": 2407.53
 },
 {
  "en": "What about your friend back there? -If we're gonna go down...",
  "start": 2408.19,
  "end": 2411.82
 },
 {
  "en": "... might as well go down swinging.",
  "start": 2411.84,
  "end": 2413.36
 },
 {
  "en": "All right.",
  "start": 2422.94,
  "end": 2424.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on, come on, come on.",
  "start": 2424.83,
  "end": 2426.89
 },
 {
  "en": "We are in business. It's going through.",
  "start": 2430.88,
  "end": 2433.81
 },
 {
  "en": "All right.",
  "start": 2434.11,
  "end": 2435.34
 },
 {
  "en": "Come on, Sara, pick up. Pick up, pick up, pick up.",
  "start": 2435.45,
  "end": 2438.01
 },
 {
  "en": "Sara.",
  "start": 2461.47,
  "end": 2463.44
 },
 {
  "en": "Hello?",
  "start": 2484.57,
  "end": 2486.23
 },
 {
  "en": "Hello, Michael?",
  "start": 2486.75,
  "end": 2488.22
 },
 {
  "en": "Michael?",
  "start": 2488.54,
  "end": 2490.2
 },
 {
  "en": "Michael?",
  "start": 2490.56,
  "end": 2492.32
 }
]